sequenceDiagram
 participant D as Decisions<br/>Accounts
 participant DB as SQLite tx
 participant E as EventHub
 participant S as http SSE
 participant W as web<br/>App/store
 participant P as push Notifier
 D->>DB: 変更 + events row
 D->>E: publish / notifyConnection
 E->>DB: afterCommitへ副作用登録
 alt rollback
 DB-->>D: 例外、bus通知なし
 else commit
 DB-->>E: hooks実行
 E-->>S: user event / connection wake
 E-->>P: decision created/updated
 S-->>W: id/type/data (履歴since・Last-Event-ID)
 W->>W: bump → useResource再GET → 画面反映
 P->>P: APNs送信、無効tokenだけ削除
 end
 Note over D,W: HTTP受付・DB確定・配送受付<br/>画面反映は別の観測
 Note over S,W: 切断後はbackoff再接続<br/>停止/abort時unsubscribe/wake
